The Orbit skin for Roundcube Webmail is an adaptation of the Elastic skin.

Elastic: Copyright (c) The Roundcube Dev Team, by Aleksander Machniak.
https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/tree/master/skins/elastic

Elastic is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License.
As required by its ShareAlike term, this adaptation is distributed under the same
license: http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes: colours, typography and corner radii follow the EDS Orbit design system; the
task menu and the login page are reduced for use inside Orbit; controls a session
may not use are hidden. No Elastic file is modified. The compiled stylesheets are built
from Elastic's own sources, unchanged, at image build time.

The Elastic files this skin inherits at runtime keep their own licenses, listed in
Elastic's README.md (Bootstrap, FontAwesome, Roboto).

images/logo.svg is the EDS Labs mark. It is not covered by the license above.
